# Blockuduko

A Python implementation of Blockudoku with a Gymnasium RL environment and MaskablePPO training pipeline.

## Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

## Run Tests

```bash
pytest
```

## Train Agent

```bash
python -m blockuduko.rl.train --timesteps 500000 --eval-freq 10000
```

TensorBoard logs are written to `./logs/`.

## Evaluate Model

```bash
python -m blockuduko.rl.train --evaluate models/best_model.zip --episodes 100
```

## Project Structure

- `blockuduko/game/` — core game engine (board, pieces, scoring, step logic)
- `blockuduko/rl/` — Gymnasium environment and training scripts
- `tests/` — unit tests
